{"id":"06030f0452dddcf8","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism.md","title":"ZFC Cat Epimorphism","display":"df-zfc-cat-epimorphism — ZFC Cat Epimorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-epimorphism — ZFC Cat Epimorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-epimorphism — ZFC Cat Epimorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(f,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatEpimorphism}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatEpimorphism}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}epimorphism}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatEpimorphism}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in C_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(\ns(g)=t(f)\\land s(h)=t(f)\\land t(g)=t(h)\n\\land\\circ(\\langle g,f\\rangle)=\\circ(\\langle h,f\\rangle)\n\\to g=h\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}epimorphism}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatEpimorphism}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in C_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(\ns(g)=t(f)\\land s(h)=t(f)\\land t(g)=t(h)\n\\land\\circ(\\langle g,f\\rangle)=\\circ(\\langle h,f\\rangle)\n\\to g=h\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cancellation law quantifies only over morphisms composable after <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> and having a common codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatEpimorphism}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}epimorphism}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatEpimorphism}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in C_1\\\\\n&\\land\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(\ns(g)=t(f)\\land s(h)=t(f)\\land t(g)=t(h)\n\\land\\circ(\\langle g,f\\rangle)=\\circ(\\langle h,f\\rangle)\n\\to g=h\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1030,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1559","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism.md|58-df-zfc-cat-epimorphism]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c"]}